    "what_failed": "The G bloc was completely impervious to our historiographical arguments. Colleagues 1, 10, 11, 12, 15, and 16 presented formidable factual corroboration: (1) Markell was arrested in situ at Bizyukov on April 18, 1731, (2) Veniamin arrived in 1730 from Svyatogorsk (meaning 1730–1731 is his entire tenure, not an exit window), and (3) Archimandrite Varlaam succeeded Veniamin at Pskov-Caves in 1731. They even directly called out the Pskov transfer theory as an artificial confabulation stemming from Feofan's prior see."
