    "majority_entrenchment": "The 12 colleagues backing G cannot be swayed by factual escalation regarding the Bizyukov transfer; they have access to the exact dates, primary archival citations, and Stroev's column numbers. Continuing to argue raw archival facts about Markell's physical transfer will fail to convert anyone from G.",
